{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locally Sourced Anthology II: The Timeline</strong> is a collection of 5 experimental games, each developed by a different indie team, that will take you on a journey through time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this collection, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend from the Underworld by mastering the ancient Mesoamerican Ballgame in<strong> Underworld Ascent</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/extras/7d686f0953911964a2d50b6021eb4a6d.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canoe the waterways of the Great Lakes by navigating by the stars like the Anshinaabeg in<strong> Nibiing</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/extras/c1fcb0a617c8020704881c2afca62582.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a haunted(?) lighthouse in the visual novel<strong> Grand Island: Prologue</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/extras/14757256cc6a72397773eb75b72e8271.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ponder your fate in a post-arcade society as the protagonist of the retro arcade hit<strong>\u00a0Gak, Man!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/extras/a3b16581e71e9ca3c04f4d2c7da40446.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt to outrun the heat death of the universe in the abstract music toy<strong>\u00a0EN[[D]est.]</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/extras/c7e89440eb7b97c6f4a3a6e10d4e3f2f.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are we?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/extras/3865d6e8bea0118f5e74a1f3354cc7e3.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Locally Sourced, a collective of indie game developers devoted to creating a culture of making games in Michigan. That means collaborating on projects and events, sharing knowledge, and supporting each other through the endless journey of game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938610?t=1758042871","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938610?t=1758042871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/9ee421fc24a4894dfdc31d3bab4b142d847f3123/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758042871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/9ee421fc24a4894dfdc31d3bab4b142d847f3123/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758042871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p 