3938610/extras/a3b16581e71e9ca3c04f4d2c7da40446.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt to outrun the heat death of the universe in the abstract music toy<strong>\u00a0EN[[D]est.]</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/extras/c7e89440eb7b97c6f4a3a6e10d4e3f2f.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are we?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/extras/3865d6e8bea0118f5e74a1f3354cc7e3.avif?t=1758042871\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Locally Sourced, a collective of indie game developers devoted to creating a culture of making games in Michigan. That means collaborating on projects and events, sharing knowledge, and supporting each other through the endless journey of game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Flyover Games","Blueshift Interactive "],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938610/15695eda5b0884b3d0516f332f360d1b7a3fe3f8/header.jpg?t=1758042871","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938610/1028582910/47e201a86868960487e3194ad4035c8de47ad191/1755463767/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755872911","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938610/1028582910/47e201a86868960487e3194ad4035c8de47ad191/1755463767/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755872911","highlight":true,"hls_h264":